              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero ntutinye, ewe Yakobo musavyi wanje, ni k’Uhoraho agize; nturanduke umutima, ewe Isirayeli: kuko rāba nzogukiza ngukūre kure, uruvyaro rwawe ndarukūre mu gihugu rwajanywemwo ar’ inyagano; Yakobo azogaruka, kand’ azoba amahoro ata nkomanzi, kandi nta wuzomutera ubgoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
