        },
        {
          "text": "Muri vyo hazoba gushima, n’ijwi ry’abanezerewe: kandi nzobagwiza, ntibazoba bake; nzobaha icubahiro, ntibazoba abo hasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.30.19",
